    "description": "EBO BizzTech Solutions plc. is an enterprise technology company based in Addis Ababa. We build and support the systems Ethiopian organisations use to manage their finances, operations and compliance. We are hiring a Marketing and Business Development Coordinator to lead our marketing and sales, from the first conversation with a client to the signed contract. The products and services you will be taking to market: EBO ERP ( eboerp.com ): a complete accounting system with more than fourteen modules, available in versions for twelve industries and built around Ethiopian tax rules. EBO POS ( ebopos.com ): a point-of-sale system for shops, supermarkets, restaurants and service outlets, connected to stock and accounts. EBO E-Invoicing ( eboinvoice.com ): our certified electronic invoicing system, which meets the Ministry of Revenues’ requirements. EBO CRM ( ebocrm.net ): one place to manage leads, sales pipelines, tenders, clients and after-sales service. EBO Hisab ( ebohisab.com ): bookkeeping services for small and growing businesses. BunaPath ( bunapath.com ): a coffee management system that follows coffee from the cooperative to the export container. Other services ( ebobizztech.com ): licensed software from global partners such as Kaspersky, custom-built systems, and training through EBO Academy. You will lead our marketing strategy across all these products, find and win new clients, and work with our business analysts to match each client with the right solutions. You will also lead our bids and tenders and coordinate our independent sales contractors. As the company grows, a sales team will be built around this role, and you will help shape it. Main duties: Prepare and carry out EBO’s marketing and sales plan, with clear targets for each product and market segment. Manage our social media on Facebook, LinkedIn, TikTok, YouTube and Telegram, and create posts and videos in English and Amharic. Prepare brochures, presentations and other marketing materials, and represent EBO at exhibitions and events. Find and follow up leads, present and demonstrate our products, prepare proposals and negotiate terms. Keep the sales pipeline up to date in EBO CRM and look after existing clients. Follow relevant bids and tenders, and coordinate complete and timely submissions. Onboard, support and motivate our independent sales contractors. Report weekly and monthly on marketing activity, sales and revenue.",
